WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.788 line:8%
Open Help & support and choose Send feedback.

00:00:03.788 --> 00:00:08.523 line:8%
Select a problem, improvement or question, and the relevant area.

00:00:09.528 --> 00:00:15.657 line:8%
Write a short title and describe the steps, what happened and what you expected.

00:00:15.657 --> 00:00:17.846 line:8%
Leave out student personal information.

00:00:18.854 --> 00:00:20.744 line:8%
Send and keep the reference.

00:00:20.744 --> 00:00:26.037 line:8%
Open My feedback to see its status and any response from a Super Admin.
